sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant E as Managed Extension
  participant N as Native Host
  participant B as Local Broker
  participant M as MCP Server
  participant A as Approved Agent
  participant P as Shared Page

  U->>E: Share current tab for 15 minutes
  E->>N: tab_shared(tab, origin, capabilities, ttl)
  N->>B: Forward grant over secured Named Pipe
  B->>B: Validate browser identity and signed policy
  B-->>E: grant_id and SHARED state

  A->>M: MCP tool call(tab_handle, arguments)
  M->>B: execute(operation_id, tool, arguments)
  B->>B: Validate caller, owner, grant, origin and policy

  alt Request denied
    B->>B: Write redacted denial audit
    B-->>M: Stable policy error
    M-->>A: MCP error
  else Request authorized
    B->>N: execute_browser_command
    N->>E: Native Messaging command
    E->>E: Revalidate tab, document, frame and ref
    E->>P: Dispatch once through bounded CDP operation
    P-->>E: Browser result or event receipt
    E-->>N: Bounded result
    N-->>B: Operation result
    B->>B: DLP, output budget and redacted audit
    B-->>M: Sanitized result
    M-->>A: MCP content
  end

  Note over B,E: Navigation, revocation, disconnect or TTL expiry invalidates the grant
  Note over B,A: A dispatched timeout returns OUTCOME_UNKNOWN and is never replayed automatically
